Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Redesign: minimal theme + sidebar, Calendar P&L page,
 Performance page with heatmap
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Clean minimal light/dark theme (neutral surfaces, vivid profit/loss colors, brand red accent)
- Desktop sidebar navigation; mobile bottom nav: ภาพรวม/ปฏิทิน/Performance/ประวัติ/ตั้งค่า
- Calendar page: monthly P&L grid with weekly totals, month/year views, KPIs, click day -> history
- Performance page: KPIs, cumulative P&L, daily P&L, day x hour heatmap, weekday/hour bars, long vs short
- Theme-aware charts; bump build + SW cache

